[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2889258632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106576#issuecomment-2889258632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106576","id":2889258632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sNpaI","user":{"login":"zmn-hamid","id":129656474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7pmmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129656474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid","html_url":"https://github.com/zmn-hamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T22:58:32Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T22:58:32Z","body":"A related proposal was posted in godotengine/godot-proposals#11148","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2889258632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891823986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106576#issuecomment-2891823986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106576","id":2891823986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sXbty","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T17:50:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T17:50:57Z","body":"Note doing so is possible in a hacky manner assuming specific node layout etc. Simple example:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorInspectorPlugin\n\nfunc _can_handle(object: Object) -> bool:\n\treturn true\n\nfunc _parse_property(object, type, name, hint_type, hint_string, usage_flags, wide) -> bool:\n\tif object.get_class() == \"EditorPropertyArray\":\n\t\tvar size_label_container: Control = object.get_child(2).get_child(0).get_child(0)\n\t\tsize_label_container.hide()\n\treturn false\n\nfunc _parse_end(object: Object) -> void:\n\tif object is Resource:\n\t\tadd_custom_control(ResourceGroupHider.new())\n\t\t\nclass ResourceGroupHider:\n\textends Control\n\t\n\tfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t\tvar resource_group_container: Control = get_parent().get_child(-2)\n\t\tresource_group_container.hide()\n\t\tqueue_free()\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a458fa5-93f3-491b-a814-18cc6a1cdbd5)\n\nOf course such workaround might need tweaking between different engine versions etc. (and probably a good idea to add some validation / error handling).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891823986/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891968235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106576#issuecomment-2891968235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106576","id":2891968235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sX-7r","user":{"login":"zmn-hamid","id":129656474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7pmmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129656474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid","html_url":"https://github.com/zmn-hamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T18:44:53Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T18:46:46Z","body":"> Note doing so is possible in a hacky manner assuming specific node layout etc. Simple example:\n> \n\nThank you so much for the help, it works for me, appreciate it.\nAnd yeah it needs a bit of tweaking, for example the `size_label_container` object might be null so you gotta handle that. and also this code only hides the size field when you add an item. there's unfortunately no signal for when the array was simply opened, so you'll see that if you have an empty array.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891968235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892041914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106576#issuecomment-2892041914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106576","id":2892041914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sYQ66","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T19:20:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T19:20:27Z","body":"> and also this code only hides the size field when you add an item. there's unfortunately no signal for when the array was simply opened, so you'll see that if you have an empty array.\n\nOh, indeed. This should do (and yeah, it's ugly):\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorInspectorPlugin\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tvar editor_tree: SceneTree = EditorInterface.get_base_control().get_tree()\n\teditor_tree.node_added.connect(on_editor_node_added)\n\nfunc on_editor_node_added(node: Node) -> void:\n\tif node.get_class() == \"EditorPropertyArray\":\n\t\tnode.child_entered_tree.connect(func(child: Node) -> void:\n\t\t\tif child is PanelContainer:\n\t\t\t\tvar hide_size_label_container := func() -> void:\n\t\t\t\t\tvar size_label_container: Control = child.get_child(0).get_child(0)\n\t\t\t\t\tsize_label_container.hide()\n\t\t\t\thide_size_label_container.call_deferred()\n\t\t)\n\nfunc _can_handle(object: Object) -> bool:\n\treturn true\n\nfunc _parse_end(object: Object) -> void:\n\tif object is Resource:\n\t\tadd_custom_control(ResourceGroupHider.new())\n\t\t\nclass ResourceGroupHider:\n\textends Control\n\t\n\tfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t\tvar resource_group_container: Control = get_parent().get_child(-2)\n\t\tresource_group_container.hide()\n\t\tqueue_free()\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892041914/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892203229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106576#issuecomment-2892203229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106576","id":2892203229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sY4Td","user":{"login":"zmn-hamid","id":129656474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7pmmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129656474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid","html_url":"https://github.com/zmn-hamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T20:35:19Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T20:36:03Z","body":"> > and also this code only hides the size field when you add an item. there's unfortunately no signal for when the array was simply opened, so you'll see that if you have an empty array.\n> \n> Oh, indeed. This should do (and yeah, it's ugly):\n\nOh this works like a charm. Appreciate it. Gonna make the beta version of the addon and attribute to you (and also study it :D)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892203229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892290277","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106576#issuecomment-2892290277","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106576","id":2892290277,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sZNjl","user":{"login":"zmn-hamid","id":129656474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7pmmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129656474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid","html_url":"https://github.com/zmn-hamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith